{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Interactive Light from Muzzle Flashes.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Interactive Light from Muzzle Flashes.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"interactive light from muzzle flashes interactive light from muzzle flashes","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Interactive Light from Muzzle Flashes.md","fileName":"Interactive Light from Muzzle Flashes.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Interactive Light from Muzzle Flashes","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 18:17\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Particle and Destruction VFX]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Particle and Destruction VFX","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Interactive Light from Muzzle Flashes.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Interactive Light from Muzzle Flashes.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"interactive light from muzzle flashes interactive light from muzzle flashes","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Interactive Light from Muzzle Flashes.md","fileName":"Interactive Light from Muzzle Flashes.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Interactive Light from Muzzle Flashes","heading":"Interactive Light from Muzzle Flashes","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A muzzle-flash footage element needs an appropriate scale, timing, color, and position at the barrel, but a bright flash should also briefly change nearby illumination. The book duplicates foreground and background plates, uses soft roto mattes to isolate wall and actor regions facing the flash, and raises their exposure only for the flash frames. A cast shadow can complete the exchange between the light source and the scene. The brief change must occur in the right locations rather than brighten every pixel equally.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Particle and Destruct